 "intro_zh": "卡杰拉霍庙宇群建于章德拉王朝，其于公元950年至1050年间达到统治的鼎盛时期。目前仅存有约20座庙宇，它们分为三组不同的群体，分属于两个不同的宗教印度教和耆那教。在这里，建筑与雕塑达到了完美的平衡。著名的坎达里亚寺庙饰有大量内容丰富、绚丽多姿的雕塑，是印度艺术中的经典之作。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "The temples at Khajuraho were built during the Chandella dynasty, which reached its apogee between 950 and 1050. Only about 20 temples remain; they fall into three distinct groups and belong to two different religions – Hinduism and Jainism. They strike a perfect balance between architecture and sculpture. The Temple of Kandariya is decorated with a profusion of sculptures that are among the greatest masterpieces of Indian art.",
 "intro_en_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_local": "",
 "intro_local_source": null,
